---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="notice" role="note"><strong>DRAFT — NOT FOR PUBLICATION.</strong> This page is a placeholder pending review. It makes no statements about what data is or is not collected. Complete and review with qualified advice before release.</p>
  <section>
    <h2>Items to complete</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Who is the data controller / studio contact.</li>
      <li>What data the game and this website collect (if any), and why.</li>
      <li>Third-party services used (analytics, ads, purchases, form handling, hosting).</li>
      <li>Retention, user rights and how to make requests.</li>
      <li>Children's privacy and App Store privacy label consistency.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
